        },
        {
          "word": " system.",
          "start": 182.48,
          "end": 182.58,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, it happens all the time with all the people who...",
      "start": 182.9,
      "end": 186.56,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
