          "end": 2314.75,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "who (unintelligible) this. Shakira: Makruh (\u0645\u06a9\u0631\u0648\u0647). A woman: Oh, my God.",
