          "end": 2329.73,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " jurisprudence.",
          "start": 2329.73,
          "end": 2330.75,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They never say \"Bism Allah Arrahman Arraheem (1:1).\"",
