        },
        {
          "word": " and",
          "start": 2760.74,
          "end": 2761.24,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " I",
          "start": 2761.24,
          "end": 2761.36,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " tend",
          "start": 2761.36,
          "end": 2761.36,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 2761.36,
          "end": 2761.56,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " say,",
          "start": 2762.0,
          "end": 2762.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and I turned to say \"Allahu Akbar. Al hamdu Lillahi Rabbil \u2018Alameen (1:2).\" So, there is no time to say it secretly or loud.",
