          "end": 4147.99,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " for",
          "start": 4149.31,
          "end": 4149.61,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " help.",
          "start": 4149.61,
          "end": 4151.35,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, obviously we are speaking with God.",
      "start": 4152.77,
      "end": 4154.65,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 4152.77,
          "end": 4153.45,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " obviously",
          "start": 4154.65,
          "end": 4154.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 4154.65,
          "end": 4154.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " are",
          "start": 4154.65,
          "end": 4154.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " speaking",
          "start": 4154.65,
          "end": 4154.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " with",
          "start": 4154.65,
          "end": 4154.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God.",
          "start": 4154.65,
          "end": 4154.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We're calling God \"Only You, God, we worship; Only You, we ask for help.\" And then we turn around and say",
