          "start": 4384.17,
          "end": 4384.17,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " Jesus",
          "start": 4384.17,
          "end": 4384.17,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " Christ.",
          "start": 4384.17,
          "end": 4384.17,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Somewhere in Quran, it says that before you die, you have to believe in him, too.",
