          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, He created death, right? Dr. Khalifa: Right.",
      "start": 5559.22,
      "end": 5559.22,
      "speaker": "Shakira",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Now,",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Shakira"
        },
        {
          "word": " He",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Shakira"
        },
        {
          "word": " created",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Shakira"
        },
        {
          "word": " death,",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Shakira"
        },
        {
          "word": " right?",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Shakira"
        },
        {
          "word": " Dr.",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Shakira"
        },
        {
          "word": " Khalifa:",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Shakira"
        },
        {
          "word": " Right.",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Shakira"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, once He created death, then He, out of clay, He made Adam.",
      "start": 5559.22,
      "end": 5559.22,
      "speaker": "Shakira",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Now,",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Shakira"
        },
        {
          "word": " once",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Shakira"
        },
