          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " scripture...",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. Shakira: That I... M\u00e3 Sh\u00e3 All\u00e3h, I hope, IN SHAA ALLAH, my mother will be guided.",
      "start": 5559.22,
      "end": 5559.22,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
