          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " what",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " she",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " says.",
          "start": 5559.22,
          "end": 5559.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If she is not doing the Shahada correct, she's not taking heed.",
